{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（ちゃんと落ち着けてるように見えるけど──\r\n一応、声をかけておこう）","trans":"（看起来她挺镇定的——\n还是先跟她说一声吧）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"","text":"待ってるな","trans":"我等着你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"","text":"大丈夫そうだな","trans":"看来没问题","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"","text":"いけそうか？","trans":"能行吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4803001000210020","name":"MEMちょ","text":"うん！\r\nいい報告を期待しててくださーい","trans":"嗯！\n请期待我的好消息——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（この調子なら安心だ）","trans":"（这样我就放心了）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4803001000210030","name":"MEMちょ","text":"もちろん！\r\nこのために準備してきたんだから","trans":"当然！\n我可是为了这个才准备到现在的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（うん、よかった）","trans":"（嗯，太好了）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4803001000210040","name":"MEMちょ","text":"──えっ？\r\nごめん、なんて……？","trans":"——诶？\n抱歉，你说什么……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（……！\r\n俺が集中を乱しちゃったな……！）","trans":"（……！\n是我打乱了她的集中……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}